        "title": "Write the equation",
        "text": "Want to solve $${10}^6\\times2^{\\left(-\\frac{n}{10}\\right)}=24$$.",
        "variabilization": {},
        "oer": "",
        "license": ""
    },
    {
        "id": "adb5110A253-explogwild-P06a-h2",
        "type": "hint",
        "dependencies": [
            "adb5110A253-explogwild-P06a-h1"
        ],
        "title": "Isolate $$n$$",
        "text": "Divide both sides by $${10}^6$$: \\n\\n$$2^{\\left(-\\frac{n}{10}\\right)}=\\frac{24}{{10}^6}$$",
        "variabilization": {},
        "oer": "",
        "license": ""
    },
    {
        "id": "adb5110A253-explogwild-P06a-h3",
        "type": "hint",
        "dependencies": [
            "adb5110A253-explogwild-P06a-h2"
        ],
        "title": "Isolate $$n$$",
        "text": "To cancel exponentials, apply a logarithm to both sides.",
        "variabilization": {},
        "oer": "",
        "license": ""
    },
    {
        "id": "adb5110A253-explogwild-P06a-h4",
        "type": "hint",
        "dependencies": [
            "adb5110A253-explogwild-P06a-h3"
        ],
        "title": "After applying the logarithm",
        "text": "Apply log base $$2$$ to both sides of the equation. \\n\\n$$\\log_{2}\\left(2^{\\left(-\\frac{n}{10}\\right)}\\right)=\\log_{2}\\left(\\frac{24}{{10}^6}\\right)$$",
        "variabilization": {},
        "oer": "",
        "license": ""
    },
    {
        "id": "adb5110A253-explogwild-P06a-h5",
        "type": "hint",
        "dependencies": [
            "adb5110A253-explogwild-P06a-h4"
        ],
        "title": "LHS",
        "text": "Cancel the exponent on the left: \\n\\n$$\\frac{-n}{10}=\\log_{2}\\left(\\frac{24}{{10}^6}\\right)$$",
        "variabilization": {},
        "oer": "",
        "license": ""
    },
    {
        "id": "adb5110A253-explogwild-P06a-h6",
        "type": "hint",
        "dependencies": [
            "adb5110A253-explogwild-P06a-h5"
        ],
        "title": "RHS",
        "text": "Apply law of logarithms for quotients:\\n\\n$$\\frac{-n}{10}=\\log_{2}\\left(24\\right)-\\log_{2}\\left({10}^6\\right)$$",
        "variabilization": {},
        "oer": "",
        "license": ""
    },
    {
        "id": "adb5110A253-explogwild-P06a-h7",
        "type": "hint",
        "dependencies": [
            "adb5110A253-explogwild-P06a-h6"
        ],
        "title": "Eliminate negative signs",
        "text": "$$\\frac{-n}{10}=\\log_{2}\\left(24\\right)-\\log_{2}\\left({10}^6\\right)$$ is the same as $$\\frac{n}{10}=\\log_{2}\\left({10}^6\\right)-\\log_{2}\\left(24\\right)$$",
        "variabilization": {},
        "oer": "",
        "license": ""
    },
    {
        "id": "adb5110A253-explogwild-P06a-h8",
        "type": "hint",
        "dependencies": [
            "adb5110A253-explogwild-P06a-h7"
        ],
        "title": "Evaluate",
        "text": "$$n=10(\\log_{2}\\left({10}^6\\right)-\\log_{2}\\left(24\\right))$$ which is approximately $$153$$ steps",
        "variabilization": {},
        "oer": "",
        "license": ""
    }
